Idon Throom.wikitext:
{{OrdoHereticusPortal}}
'''Idon Throom''' is an [[Interrogator]] for the [[Ordo Hereticus]] [[High Inquisitor]] [[Tranquelda Horfus]]. He is also a [[Lieutenant (Imperial Guard)|Lieutenant]] in the [[Star Devils]] [[Tempestus Scions#Inquisitorial Storm Troopers|Inquisitorial Storm Trooper]] [[Regiment]], which is among the [[Imperial]] forces that serve the High Inquisitor.{{Fn|1}}
==History==
In [[M42]] Throom and large number of [[Tranquelda Horfus|Horfus]]'s forces, were sent to gather information about the [[Thousand Sons]]' combat doctrine, during the [[Prosperan Rift War]]. Among the worlds visited by the [[Interrogator]], was the invaded [[Mausoleum World]] [[Harlecrypt Tertius]]. By the time, Throom arrived, the [[Imperial]] forces defending the world, had drove the Thousand Sons and their allies into a stalemate. This allowed the Interrogator to deploy his forces on the battlefield, to observe the Thousand Sons and allow Throom to interrogate any surviving witnesses to their attacks. While he met with success with his witnesses' testimony, though Throom executed some for cowardice in battle, the Interrogator failed with observing the Thousand Sons. His deployed forces were largely destroyed and while he was able to recover the [[Pict]] [[Servitors]] that they protected, this was of limited use. The [[Warp]] power the Thousand Sons' [[Sorcerer]]s wielded, made it extremely difficult for them to be captured on Picts. Either Throom's Servitors would stop working or become confused and only a few Sorcerers Picts were taken clearly. While on Harlecrypt Tertius, the Interrogator sent a report to [[High Inquisitor]] [[Tranquelda Horfus]], about what he had learned about the Thousand Sons so far. Throom admitted, though, that it was not a lot of solid information and that his forces had already suffered severe losses.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[White Dwarf 469]], pgs. 95-97 — ''Warpcoven Kill Teams''
