Idravain Mors.wikitext:
{{DarkAngelsPortal}}
[[Image:Mors.jpg|thumb|right|220px|{{PAGENAME}}, prior to becoming a [[Space Marine Dreadnought|Dreadnought]]{{Fn|1}}]]
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a member of the [[Dark Angels]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]] during the [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}

Like many Dark Angels of his era he had multiple titles including a Knight-[[Sergeant]] of the [[Order of the Shattered Mantle]] and a Knight-Seneschal of the [[Deathwing]]. Mors was inducted into the inner circle of the Deathwing after the [[Siege of Mykana]] when he took a shot meant for his commander. His armour bore the bone white which signified a warrior of the Deathwing had taken a mortal wound meant for another as well as the crossed keys on his left greave and the initiation icons on his right pauldron which symbolize him as a warrior who is a master in the art of the Deathwing.{{Fn|1}}

During the [[Thramas Crusade]] he would fall again, once again shielding the [[Praetor (Rank)|Praetor]] of the Shattered Mantle from [[Konrad Curze]] himself. He was subsequently recovered from the battlefield and interred within a [[Space Marine Dreadnought|Dreadnought]].{{Fn|1}}

