Idris (Inquisitor).wikitext:
{{OrdoMalleusPortal}}
{{ambig|subject=Inquisitor|disambiguation=Idris}}
'''Idris''' is an [[Inquisitor]] of the [[Ordo Malleus]], who once served as an [[Interrogator]] for Inquisitor [[Argento (Inquisitor)|Argento]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
She served alongside her fellow [[Interrogator]] [[Covenant]], until they discovered that [[Argento (Inquisitor)|Argento]] was attempting to create a [[Living Saint]]. The [[Radical]] [[Inquisitor]] sought to use the Saint to hold the [[Emperor]]'s spirit, but Idris and Covenant killed Argento and brought an end to his plans. Afterwards, the two were made full Inquisitors by the [[Ordo Malleus]].{{Fn|1}}

It is later revealed that Idris in fact one of the members of the [[Radical]] [[Horusian]] sect known as [[The Triumvirate]] dubbed '''The Sorceress'''.{{Fn|2}}

