Idriss Krendl.wikitext:
{{IronWarriorsPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Warsmith]] of the [[Iron Warriors]] during the [[Great Crusade]] and [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}

Commanding the 14th Grand Company during the Heresy, Krendl [[Great Siege of Lesser Damantyne|besieged]] the Fortress of [[Schadenhold]] on [[Lesser Damantyne]] and battled against loyalist Iron Warriors under [[Barabas Dantioch]]. After 366 days of siege, Dantioch detonated explosives in his own fortress, devastating the traitor ranks and badly wounding Krendl.{{Fn|1}} His body broken in the aftermath of the battle, Krendl attempted to redeem himself from his failure in the eyes of [[Perturabo]] by besieging the Great Selenic palace on [[Euphorus]]. Krendl used two massive [[Ordinatus]] siege engines recovered from [[Diamat]] in the siege.{{Fn|2}}

