Infurnace.wikitext:
{{KhornePortal}}
'''Infurnace''' is a [[Bloodthirster]] of [[Khorne]], a near-mythical monster whose tale is known to every [[Blood Claw]] of the [[Space Wolves]] [[Chapter]].{{fn|1}}

==History==
Millennia before [[M41]], '''Infurnace''' fought the [[Wolf Lord]] [[Kjarl Stormpelt]]. Its fiery likeness is carved across the saga knotwork in four of the great halls of the [[The Fang|Fang]].{{fn|1}}

During the [[Siege of the Fenris System]], Infurnace was part of the daemonic invasion on [[Svellgard]].{{fn|1}} It fought the Wolf Lords [[Sven Bloodhowl]] and [[Harald Deathwolf]], killing four of their [[Wolf Guard]]. Struck by the [[lance]] strike against the World Wolf's Lair, its flesh was nearly petrified, allowing Sven to shatter it by flying straight through it on full turbo.{{fn|2}}

==Appearance==
Infurnace has bat-like wings and coal black flesh, wreathed in white flame. Its fiery aura burned so hot that solid shot melted and missiles burst in the air before it.{{fn|2}} It wields a huge, fiery axe capable of cutting clean through the wing of a [[Thunderhawk]] in a single blow, and a chain whip of white-hot links.{{fn|1}}

