{{BloodAngelsPortal}}
'''Invictus''' is a [[Librarian]] in the [[Blood Angels]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He took part in the [[Third War of Armageddon]], where Invictus commanded a number of [[Blood Angels]] against the invading [[Orks]]. However the [[Librarian]] later lost contact with his [[Chapter]], during the conflict and had not been seen since. Several units that were under his command, disappeared from [[Armageddon]] as well.{{Fn|1}} When the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]] began, though,{{Fn|2}} the [[Imperium]] received reports that Blood Angels led by Invictus were seen taking part{{Fn|1}} in the [[Gathrog Campaign]] against the [[Green Kroosade]].{{Fn|3}} These Blood Angels would attack the flanks of Ork Warbands that were attacking Imperial outposts, but they made no contact with other Imperial forces. This led the Imperium to be unsure if it was truly Invictus taking part in the Campaign or what his intentions were. However the Librarian's identity and [[loyalty]] to the Imperium were eventually confirmed. He was later critically wounded in battle with the Green Kroosade, but survived his wounds and continued to fight against the Orks. Though the Gathrog Campaign would end in failure,{{Fn|2}} Invictus survived the Crusade.{{Fn|1}}
