{{AdeptusMechanicusPortal}}
'''Iocton Rheim''' was a [[Mechanicum]] [[Taghmata]] [[Magos Dominus]], who took part in the [[Great Crusade]] and the [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
[[Image:Iocton Rheim.jpg|thumb|200px|Iocton Rheim{{Fn|1}}]]
He was among the [[Imperium]]' forces that took part in the [[Dropsite Massacre]], which he fought from aboard his [[Abeyant]]. As the [[Traitor Legions]] fell upon upon them, Rheim drove back [[Warmaster]] [[Horus]]'s [[Traitor]] forces and aided the [[Loyalist]]s in escaping from [[Isstvan V]]. The [[Magos Dominus]] was among the few Imperials who were able to escape the Massacre and he later learned of the [[Schism of Mars|civil war]] that had erupted on [[Mars]]. Rheim was distressed by this tragic news and his mind soon saw that his next logical course of action was to eliminate the Mechanicus' [[Dark Mechanicum|dissidents]]. Above all else, though, the Magos Dominus sought to erase the traitorous [[Fabricator-General]] [[Kelbor-Hal]]'s deviant interpretation of the [[Omnissiah]]'s wisdom, before it could spread like [[Scrapcode]].{{Fn|1}} 

