Iron Kâhl.wikitext:
{{LOVPortal}}
The '''Iron Kâhl''' is a [[Leagues of Votann]] [[Ironkin]], who legends claim rose to become a [[High Kâhl]].{{Fn|1}}
==Description==
Legends concerning the Iron Kâhl have existed for millennia and have given the [[Ironkin]] different guises. All of the stories though, describe the Iron Kâhl as a humble being who was raised to greatness by the [[Votann Ancestor Core]]s. Once given command of entire armies, the Iron Kâhl led them with nigh-supernatural strategic capabilities. In recent times, however, these legends have become more prevalent as tales have arisen of Ironkin, who have matched the Iron Kâhl's abilities. It is known that Ironkin [[Memnyr Strategist]]s are able to briefly achieve the Iron Kâhl's feats, by flooding their minds with massive data flows. This is rarely done though, as the process drastically reduces the Memnyr's lifespan senescence. Because of this, many [[Kin (Leagues of Votann)|Kin]] believe these rumors are actually describing the deeds of numerous Ironkin, rather than a single Iron Kâhl.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
