Iron Magus.wikitext:
{{BlackLegionPortal}}
[[Image:IronMagus.jpg|thumb|right|200px|The Iron Magus{{Fn|1d}}]]
The '''Iron Magus''' was the name given to one of the eight individuals which made up the mysterious [[Hand of Abaddon]], an organization within the [[Black Legion]] dedicated to reconstituting the [[Anathame]].{{Fn|1a}}

Representing the 4th of the Hand, the {{PAGENAME}} is a [[Heretek]] of the [[Dark Mechanicus]]. It is a hulking creature with cybernetic [[Technomandrite]]s and spidery-like mechanical limbs.{{Fn|1a}} The Iron Magus was the one responsible for operating and maintaining the [[Blackstone Fortress]] which the Hand used as their base. Like all of the Hand, she had its own retinue and had an entourage of mechanical horrors and slaves.{{Fn|1b}}

The Iron Magus was the most proactive in attempting to counter the growing potential and influence of [[Tenebrus]]'s acolyte [[Tharador Yheng]] within the Hand. During a power struggle, she was able to capture Yheng and bring her to the hidden command room of the Blackstone Fortress.{{Fn|1c}} But before she could execute Yheng, the [[Battle of the Stygius Gilt]] began and the Heretek became desperate to stabilize the now-damaged Fortress. In the ensuing chaos Yheng was able to escape and watched as the Iron Magus was incinerated by the destabilized core of the Fortress.{{Fn|1d}}

