Irriane Vail.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}

'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Palatine-lady]] of [[Beta-Garmon II]] during the [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}

In 101006.[[M31]], a fleet sent by [[Rogal Dorn]] to [[Isstvan]] stopped in the [[Beta-Garmon System]]. Lady Irriane Vail offered them three regiments of her [[Imperialis Militia]], the [[Secundus Levy]].{{Fn|1}}

