Isak.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
{{ambig|subject=bodyguard|disambiguation=Isak}}
'''Isak'''{{Fn|Note 1}} was the personal bodyguard of [[Marshal (Imperial Guard)|Marshal]] [[Edric Croe]] at the time of the [[Siege of Vervunhive]].{{Fn|1a}}

At one point in the Siege, High Master [[Salvador Sondar]] of [[Vervunhive]] succumbed to the whispers of [[Chaos]] and lowered the hive's [[void shields]], allowing the invading [[Ferrozoica]]n soldiers to storm the hive's defences ''en masse''. Marshal Croe was leading a reinforcement corps to the frontline when the shield dropped and, realising that the sight of him retreating would destroy the troops' morale, sent Isak to kill Sondar and restore the energy field.{{Fn|1b}}

Isak and his men met up with other Imperial forces in the Upper Spine of Vervunhive and together they fought against Sondar's corrupted [[servitor]]s to reach the High Master's chambers. As they prepared to kill Sondar, however, his last defence revealed itself: a horrifically [[Mutant|mutated]], artificially constructed meat-beast. In the ensuing battle, Isak was decapitated by the beast.{{Fn|1c}}

