Iustices.wikitext:
{{AdeptusCustodesPortal}}
'''Iustices''' is a member of the Tribunate Pentekontarchoi of the [[Adeptus Custodes]] in the [[Era Indomitus]].{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
Iustices was part of the retinue of Custodes led by [[Colquan]] that accompanied [[Guilliman]] to [[Fleet Primus]] in order to watch over and protect him. The custodian shared his responsibilities with Captain [[Messinius]] of protecting the [[Primarch]] something that Messinius did not like. After a few words with the captain, Iustices told Messinius that he was aware that [[space marine]]s like him considered the Adeptus Custodes to be too inactive and that their efforts could have prevented more lives and worlds from being lost. After hearing this, Messinius retorted that he knew the Custodes' opinion on the Adeptus Astartes, that they were unsophisticated brutes, made only to kill while the Custodes were a more refined sort and closer to the [[Emperor]]. Despite this, Messenius thought that both opinions were wrong and that he was glad to have the custodians amongst the forces of the [[Indomitus Crusade]]. Concurring with Messinius, Iustices promised to remind his brothers that they were more space marines like the captain himself.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
