Jada-kyn.wikitext:
{{AdeptaSororitasPortal}}
'''Jada-kyn''' is an [[Adepta Sororitas]] [[Canoness]], that was declared to be the hero of the '''Penitents' Gulf''' and was among the many that appeared during the [[Indomitus Crusade]].{{Fn|1}}

Because of her heroism, scores of pilgrims would pick up Jada-kyn's spent [[bolt]] shell casings, after each of the Crusade's battles she took part in. Each casing was considered to be a priceless relic and they were painstakingly engraved with holy tracts or scenes of devotion. To some of those that possessed them, Jada-kyn's casings were held as sources of physical faith, while others thought they were guaranteed to act as amulets to ward away [[psychic|witchery]].{{Fn|1}}

