Jae Heydari.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
{{QuoteBox
|quote = '''''"I am counting on life in your retinue being more exciting than sitting behind a desk in my office."'''''{{Fn|2}}}}
[[Image:Jae Heydari.jpg|thumb|right|160px|Jae Heydari{{Fn|1}}]]
'''Jae Heydari''' is a [[Cold Trade|Cold Trader]] operating in the [[Koronus Expanse]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
Jae Heydari, a precious jewel of Footfall, a link in the glittering gold chain that is the Kasballica Mission among Cold Traders, a woman of countless talents and myriad mysteries, is truly the cream of the scum of the Koronus Expanse. A seasoned dealmaker and adept mediator of commerce with the enemies of Humanity, Jae has earned the great respect of many in the Footfall underworld and incurred the much, much greater hatred of her less successful rivals. Jae will not pass up any opportunity to curb the evil tongues of her enemies and keep their long knives at bay. And a Rogue Trader’s influence is her most coveted weapon – for who would dare go against the business partner of one who holds a Warrant of Trade, the gracious one anointed by the Emperor, and sent Jae Heydari’s way by providence itself? That is, of course, if the Rogue Trader chooses to add a person of such controversial repute to their retinue.{{Fn|1}}

At the Rogue Trader’s side, Jae will set out toward the distant shimmering stars that hold innumerable riches and are home to multitudes of foes. Notwithstanding her extensive knowledge of all the various things falling under the concept of “xenoheresy,” notwithstanding a honeyed eloquence that can pacify a raging daemon, Jae is hardly the kind of partner whose honesty and integrity warrant any superlatives. Dark shadows from the past can be glimpsed in her eyes, and reflections upon her future are like glints of light dancing upon cold steel. In the end, it will be up to the Lord Captain – may the God-Emperor shield them from all adversity – whether to entrust this lady with their business affairs, their money, and ultimately their life.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
