Jaekeb Dar Draconis.wikitext:
{{ImperialKnightsPortal}}
'''Sire Jaekeb Dar Draconis''' is a [[Knight]] of [[House Draconis]], piloting a [[Knight Errant]].{{Fn|1}}


==Biography==
When it was revealed that the Imperial world of [[Pyrodiah]] was a [[Necron]] [[Tomb World]], First Knight [[Jennika Tan Draconis]] led four lances of Draconis Knights in the evacuation of [[Planetary Governor]] [[Juliandros Beatifica]] from her fortress-cathedrum in [[Castigorum]]. Sire Jaekeb was a relatively inexperienced Knight, having [[Ritual of Becoming|Become]] shortly before the mission, but was nonetheless assigned to Lady Jennika's lance.{{Fn|1}}  

Due both to Jaekeb's hot-headedness and the urging of Sire [[Olphrec Dar Draconis]], he charged directly into a [[Necron Warrior]] phalanx in an attempt to earn glory and bloody his steed. As a result, his Knight was heavily damaged and Jaekeb himself severely wounded. His life was saved by the direct intervention of Lady Jennika, who held off the Necrons while their [[Sacristan]]s recovered his downed Knight.{{Fn|1}}

