Jai'tana.wikitext:
{{ChaosPortal}}
'''Jai'tana the Unshriven''' is a [[Dark Apostle]] of the [[Ten Thousand Eyes]] [[Chaos Warband|Warband]].{{Fn|1b}}
==History==
He was once an [[Ashen Blades]] [[Chaplain]] and was attached to officer [[Markog]]'s command, when the [[Chapter]]'s fleet became trapped by a [[Warp Storm]]. This led to an outbreak of infighting amongst the Ashen Blades and during it, the Chapter's [[Master of Sanctity]] was killed by Jai'tana. When they later finally freed themselves, the surviving Ashen Blades that emerged from the Warp Storm{{Fn|1b}} had all been corrupted by the forces of [[Chaos]]{{Fn|1a}}. [[Markog]] was among them{{Fn|1b}} and he formed the [[Dolorous Guard]] from the ruins of the Ashen Blades{{Fn|1a}}. Jai'tana became the Guard's [[Dark Apostle]], but eventually they joined the massive warhost of the [[Ten Thousand Eyes]] [[Chaos Warband|Warband]], which was commanded by the [[Sorcerer Lord]] [[Seraphax]]. Since then, Jai'tana has risen to become a powerful member within the Ten Thousand Eyes, who now only needs to heed to the authority of Seraphax and the [[Chaos Gods]], who the Dark Apostle worships.{{Fn|1b}} 

