Jakob DeVos.wikitext:
{{NecromundaPortal}}
'''Jakob DeVos''' was a [[Merchant Guild]]er in the [[Underhive]]s of [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]]{{Fn|1a}} who dealt with many of its gangs, including those of [[House Escher|Escher]], [[House Goliath|Goliath]] and [[House Orlock|Orlock]] provenance. He was the narrator of ''[[Necromunda: Underhive Wars]]''.{{Fn|2c}}{{Fn|2d}}

He had a deal with [[Tessera]] and her [[Banecats]] where she would delve with her gang into the bottom of the Underhive and retrieve precious [[Archeotech (Alliance)|archeotech]]. DeVos added to his stipulations that once the Banecats would establish a hideout, he would be given a place to live there. Tessera kept the letter of the deal{{Fn|2a}}, but not the spirit, as she locked him in an air-tight room where he would have asphyxiated.{{Fn|2b}} He was rescued by [[Blutvor]] and his [[Rowdy Bois]].{{Fn|2b}}

Despite Tessera's betrayal, DeVos organized a tournament in which the winning gang would help her and her gang.{{Fn|2e}} His reasoning was that whichever gang arrived at the archeotech, he'd get his cut.{{Fn|2c}}{{Fn|2d}}. His manipulations led to the founding of an [[Alliance (Necromunda)|Alliance]] between the Banecats, Rowdy Bois and competition winner [[Black Ash]], who successfully took it from the [[Dog Soldiers]]. However, also according to his planning, the alliance dissolved in favor of each leader vying to be the sole owner of the device.{{Fn|2e}}{{Fn|2f}}

