Janus Dubois.wikitext:
{{OrdoXenosPortal}}
'''Janus Dubois''' is an [[Ordo Xenos]] [[Interrogator]], who serves the [[High Inquisitor]] [[Geromius Staanberg]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
The two{{Fn|1}} were among the [[Imperium]]'s forces that took part in the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s [[Kith Campaign]] against the [[Asuryani]] and [[Drukhari]] that invaded the [[Chinchare Subsector]] in the wake of the [[Thirteenth Black Crusade]].{{Fn|2}} During the Campaign, [[Geromius Staanberg|Staanberg]] sent Dubois to investigate the numerous raids the [[Xenos]] conducted on the Imperial world [[Orthrea]]. Dubois, however, could not determine a pattern to the attacks, which occurred on sites of varying value, and the [[Interrogator]] then awaited further orders from Staanberg.{{Fn|1}} Sometime later, though, the Imperium's forces in the Kith Campaign defeated the invading Asuryani and Drukhari.{{Fn|2}}

