Janzig Danathios.wikitext:
{{ImperialNavyPortal}}
'''Janzig Danathios''' is a [[Lord Admiral]] in the [[Imperial Navy]], whose fleet is among the [[Imperial]] forces defending the [[Pankallis Sub-sector]].{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
During the conflict, Danathios's fleet fought the [[Orks]] attacking the [[Kusolst System]]. The tide would later turn in the [[Imperium]]'s favor, when the [[Obsidian Jaguars]] [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Amaqan Cuetl]]'s fleet, engaged in a series of attacks against the Orks' armada. In doing so, Cuetl gave Danathios' fleet squadrons precious time to stabilize the combat situation above [[Kusolst Prime]]. This in turn allowed the [[Imperium]] to achieve victory there, as with the void under its control, the Orks were denied reinforcements and supplies.{{Fn|1}}

