Jessivayne Y'Kamidar.wikitext:
{{ImperialKnightsPortal}}
Princess '''Jessivayne Y'Kamidar''' is an [[Imperial Knight]] and heir-apparent to [[House Kamidar]],  which is rule by her mother the [[High Queen]].{{Fn|1a}}  

==History==
She commands the [[Questoris Knight]] '''Incendor''' which is equipped with a [[Conflagration Cannon]], normally carried by the immense [[Dominus Pattern Knight]]. Incendor, however, is a one of a kind Questoris, as it was personally built for Jessivayne, by the [[Forge World]] [[Ferrovarum]], in celebration of her successfully becoming a Knight. While her legs were atrophied, and Jessivayne is required to wear [[Servo-callipers]] to walk, only the slow-witted underestimated because of her disability for long. Most others are quickly dispelled of thinking she is weak, after they look into Jessivayne's eyes and see steel running through her soul.{{Fn|1a}}  

When the [[Battle of Gathalamor]] initially began, [[Lord Commander]] [[Guilliman]] sent Imperial forces there, to defend the [[Shrine World]] until [[Indomitus Crusade Fleet Primus]] arrived. [[House Kamidar]] was among these early defenders{{Fn|1b}}, as its [[High Queen]] honored the oath her grandfather, and past [[High King]], [[Laughlen Y'Kamidar]] had sworn that they would always protect [[Gathalamor]]. As heir-apparent, Jessivayne was given command of this force{{Fn|1a}}, which consisted of five full lances of Knights to defend the [[Shrine World]] with.{{Fn|1b}}  

She was killed by [[Warpsmith]] [[Torvann Lokk]] of the [[Iron Warriors]] during the last phase of the [[Battle of Gathalamor]].{{Fn|1c}} The return of her body to [[Kamidar]] and [[Admiral]] [[Tiberion Ardemus]] using her corpse as a bargaining chip with her mother [[Orlah Y'Kamidar]] proved a major reason for the conflict between the [[Ironhold Protectorate]] and [[Imperium]].{{Fn|2}}

