Jeuns Helmawr.wikitext:
{{NecromundaPortal}}
'''Jeuns Helmawr''' was a past [[Planetary Governor]] of [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]], who succeeded her father, [[Alberoth Helmawr]].{{Fn|1}}

Alberoth had overseen the creation of the first [[Goliath]]s, which he wanted to use as a reliable and hardy workforce. They began as [[slaves]] but, after Alberoth's death, the alliance between the Goliath's creators ([[Clan House|Houses]] [[House Van Saar|Van Saar]] and [[House Escher|Escher]]) permanently ended. This set in motion events that saw the Goliaths break free of their slavery and begin taking over the factories and forges they had been forced to work in. As they maintained or even increased their production quotas, however, the Goliaths' newfound freedom did not bother Jeuns. She had always regarded her father's notion of a slave race antiquated, as she held that all of [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]]'s population belonged to [[House Helmawr]]. Jeuns would then declare that the Goliaths would be able to govern themselves, as long as they proved their continued worth to the [[Hive World]]. The Goliaths would do so and this eventually gave rise to [[House Goliath]].{{Fn|1}}

