'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is the current [[Chief Librarian]] of the [[Blood Ravens]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|3a}}

==History==
[[File:Chief Librarian Orion.jpg|thumb|right|Chief Librarian {{PAGENAME}}]]
Orion has served under [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Gabriel Angelos]] since the aftermath of the [[Tartarus]] campaign. As a former protégé of the late [[Isador Akios]], who was corrupted by [[Chaos]] on Tartarus, Orion was subject to suspicion, but the support of Captain Angelos and [[Chapter Master]] [[Azariah_Kyras|Kyras]] soon put those doubts to rest.{{Fn|1}}

During the [[Aurelian Crusade]], he was one of the [[psyker]]s tasked with battling the [[Tyranid]] [[Hive Mind]] as Angelos was en route to Aurelia. Jonah was the sole survivor of the dozen [[Librarian]]s, [[Navigator]]s, and [[Astropath]]s that accompanied Angelos, and still bears the scars of his ordeals in the [[Warp]]. His psychic abilities have allowed the Blood Ravens to root out several leftover pockets of Tyranid infestation over the last year.{{Fn|1}}

During the [[Dawn of War II: Retribution|Third Aurelian Crusade]], Orion was thought to have been killed while battling the forces of [[Chaos]], on [[Cyrene]], to allow Captain Angelos to confront their corrupted [[Chapter Master]] [[Azariah Kyras]]. However after Kyras was killed{{Fn|3a}}, Orion was found alive, but his injuries from the battle left him in a [[Sus-an Membrane]] trance{{Fn|3b}}. When Orion recovered his strength, Angelos, who was now the Blood Ravens' new Chapter Master, promoted him to [[Chief Librarian]]; in recognition of the numerous sacrifices and victories Orion had given to his [[Battle Brother]]s. In his new role Orion now desires to redefine the [[psyker]] culture within the Blood Ravens, so that heresy can not breed again within the Chapter, and he has made it his main duty to ensure none of his Chapter stray, as Kyras did.{{Fn|3a}}

Orion is currently aiding the Blood Ravens, during their campaign on the world [[Acheron (World)|Acheron]]{{Fn|3a}}

==Equipment==
Jonah Orion is equipped with a [[Force Staff]] and carries several psychic tomes that allow for the use of different psychic abilities. He may also equip a [[Force Sword]] and [[plasma pistol]].{{Fn|1}}

If the player chooses the Path of Chaos, Orion can be equipped with Forbidden Tomes that grant him dark, sorcerous powers such as The Chains of Torment. He can also equip the [[Book of Lorgar]] which greatly increases his abilities but corrupts him significantly.{{Fn|1}}

As the Blood Ravens' Chief Librarian, Orion now has a [[Cherub]]-familiar, which he uses to focus his considerable psychic power.{{Fn|3a}}

