{{UltramarinesPortal}}
'''Julianos''' is a [[Chaplain]] in the [[Ultramarines]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
In [[M42]], he led an [[Ultramarines]] strike force to attack the [[Ark of Omen]] known as the [[Colossus (Ark of Omen)|Colossus]]. This was after it had been sent by [[Abaddon the Despoiler]] to hunt down a [[Key-Fragment]], which led its [[Balefleet]] to invade the [[Imperium Sanctus]]' [[Onalpa System]]. However when the Colossus' forces dispersed to attack Onalpa's [[archeotech]]-rich worlds, they provided Julianos' strike force a crucial opening to board the now unprotected [[Space Hulk]]. Even with this advantage, though, the [[Chaos]] forces still within the Colossus were nightmarish foes and the invading [[Space Marines]] were overwhelmed and killed. Before they died, however, the Ultramarines had succeeded in making several of the Space Hulk's engines enter into a simultaneous meltdown. This triggered a series of blasts that tore the Colossus apart.{{Fn|1}}

