Juljak Nul.wikitext:
{{WorldEatersPortal}}
'''Juljak Nul''', '''The Storm Walker,''' was a [[Space Marine Dreadnought|Dreadnought]] of the [[World Eaters]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]], active during the [[Great Crusade]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
[[Image:Juljak Nul.jpg|thumb|right|275px|Juljak Nul{{Fn|1}}]]
Juljak Nul had the dual distinction of being the first [[Master of Ordnance]] of the [[World Eaters]] — when they were still known simply as the ''XIIth Legion'' — and of being one of the first of the [[Space Marine Legion|Legion's]] officers to be interred within a [[Space Marine Dreadnought|Dreadnought]] — after having been mutilated during a battle with [[Slaugth]] Murder-minds on the planet [[Rangda]].{{Fn|1}}

He was initially interred with a [[Lucifer Pattern Dreadnought]] until it sustained too much damage during [[Golgothan Slaughter|the liberation]] of [[Sarum]], after which he was transferred to a [[Contemptor Dreadnought]].{{Fn|1}}

A [[loyalist]] to the [[Emperor of Mankind|Emperor]], whose Legion had changed around him, he met his end during the [[Battle of Isstvan III]], when his [[Primarch]] [[Angron]] landed with the bulk of his [[Traitor Legions|traitorous]] Legion on [[Isstvan III]]'s blasted surface.  Nul joined the loyalist World Eaters in charging their traitor brothers and in the battle that followed killed many of them before dying.{{Fn|1}}

