Juster.wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinesPortal}}
'''Juster''' was a [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] of the [[Relictors]] [[Chapter|Chapter's]] [[4th Company (Relictors)|Fourth Company]].{{Fn|1a}}

During the [[Third War for Armageddon]], the Relictors Fourth Company deployed to the [[Equatorial Jungle]]s, ostensibly to purge the jungles of [[Feral Ork]]s which might reinforce [[Ghazghkull Mag Uruk Thraka|Ghazghkull's]] forces elsewhere on the planet.{{Fn|1b}}  In actuality, the Marines were to scour the jungle in search of a [[Chaos]] monument erected during the [[First War for Armageddon|first war for the planet]] known as [[Angron's Monolith]].{{Fn|1e}}{{Fn|1g}}

Under the command of [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Maegar]]{{Fn|1b}}, Juster led a squadron consisting of Battle-Brothers [[Nico Tarryn|Tarryn]], [[Baeloch]], [[Nabori]] and [[Kantus]] in search of the monolith.{{Fn|1a}}

Unfortunately, the squadron fell into a Feral Ork ambush that resulted in Nabori and Kantus dying and Juster being severely injured.  Although Tarryn and Baeloch attempted to carry their sergeant to safety, Juster instead ordered them to retreat with the knowledge that the monolith was near their last reported position and covered their retreat.  Juster was killed by the greenskins, but Tarryn and Baeloch were able to link up with Chapter command.{{Fn|1d}}{{Fn|1e}}

==Wargear==
Juster was armed with a [[chainsword]]; a relic of the Chapter, the sword was originally wielded by [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Bylar]] during the [[Blood Star Campaign]].{{Fn|1c}}  The sword was taken from his corpse by the [[Ork]]s.{{Fn|1f}}

