He served under [[Nugen Tarya Khan]] in the [[Battle_of_Beta-Garmon#Second_Phase|Second Phase]] of the [[Battle for Beta-Garmon]], where Hu's [[Despoiler Squad]] was deployed on [[637b Minoris-Garmon]]. While there, the squad's [[Rhino]] took a direct hit from enemy artillery and was destroyed. He survived the attack and, despite his injuries, Hu was able to recover his squadmates' bodies, conduct his Legion's rites and made it back to the Scars' lines after walking for eleven hours.{{Fn|1}}

