Kae Drusil.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a Senior [[Arbitrator]] of the [[Calixis Sector]]. She serves as the commander of the [[Divisio Immoralis]], the special task force of [[Lord Marshal (Arbites)|Lord Marshal]] [[Goreman]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
Following the assassination of her noble family at the age of fifteen, she was inducted into the [[Schola Progenium]] and eventually recruited into the [[Adeptus Arbites]]. Her childhood years had given her a burning anger and a brutal view of law enforcement, but these helped her gain a reputation of being beyond corruption. {{Fn|1}}

During a mission in coordiation with the [[Inquisition]], Drusil's faith in the absolute justice of the [[Imperium]] was tested. During the mission, Drusil was forced to undertake brutal punitiative operations against corsairs which led to terrorizing and bullying refugees and loyal Imperial servants. At the end of the mission Kae was fed up, but eventually reinvigorated when she accepted Lord Marshal [[Goreman]]'s offer to serve in the [[Divisio Immoralis]], a special Arbites task force in the [[Calixis Sector]].{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
