Kais Vral Mont'yr.wikitext:
{{TauPortal}}
'''Aun Kais Vral Mont'yr''' is an [[Ethereal]] in the [[T'au Empire]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He was among{{Fn|1}} its [[Third Sphere of Expansion]] forces{{Fn|2}} that invaded the [[Imperial]] [[Sector]]s near the [[Damocles Gulf]], in the wake of the [[13th Black Crusade]].{{Fn|3}} During the conflict, Mont'yr led the [[T'au Empire]]'s forces in a number of lighting attacks against outlying Imperial worlds. However it was his preaching of the [[Greater Good]], which perverted its citizens' minds, that made the [[Ethereal]] a terrible threat to the Imperium.{{Fn|1}} When it later launched the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s [[Mont'shi Campaign]] against the invading T'au,{{Fn|3}} the Imperium made sure to make Mont'yr amongst its highest priority targets. The Campaign's forces then sought to kill him and any other Ethereal in the conflict, in order to stop them from spreading any further [[heresy]] amongst the Imperium's population.{{Fn|1}} In the end though, the T'au Empire was victorious{{Fn|3}} and Mont'yr survived the Crusade.{{Fn|1}}

==Trivia==
