''Kais Vral Mont'yr'' was created for the [[Dark Crusade Campaign]] by the '''Hobby Center''' staff of [[Games Workshop]]'s '''Stoneridge''' store{{Fn|1}} in '''Pleasanton, California, USA'''.{{Fn|4}}

