Kalag.wikitext:
{{IronHandsPortal}}
'''Kalag''' is a [[Clan Raukaan]] [[Iron Captain]] in the [[Iron Hands]] [[Chapter]], who is taking part in the [[War in the Pariah Nexus]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
During the [[War in the Pariah Nexus|war]], Kalag joined the [[Imperium]]'s '''Paradyce Reclamation Force''' as it attempted to [[Trouble in Paradyce|save]] the besieged world [[Paradyce V]]. In the ensuing campaign, the [[Iron Captain]] led the [[Clan Raukaan]] detachment '''Strike Force Quaesitor-3''', which was equipped with many of the [[Iron Hands]]' relics. These were from the [[Horus Heresy]] and included [[Mk.III Pattern Power Armour|Mk.III helmets]] and [[Breacher Shield]]s. The Strike Force would go on to earn a number of victories on Paradyce V, but it also suffered some defeats as well. Though the Imperium's efforts to save the world later ended in failure, it is not known if Kalag left Paradyce V or if the Iron Captain is among the few Imperials who chose to remain there.{{Fn|1}} 
==Trivia==
''Kalag'' and '''Strike Force Quaesitor-3''' were created by the [[Games Workshop]] employee '''James'''. They appeared in [[White Dwarf 507]].{{Fn|1}}

