Kaleb (Inquisitor).wikitext:
{{OrdoXenosPortal}}
'''Kaleb''' was an [[Ordo Xenos]] [[Inquisitor]], who hid his face behind a featureless mask of tarnished silver. In 715.[[M41]], he arrived unannounced at the [[Jericho Reach]]'s [[Death Watch]] [[Watch Fortress|Fortress]] [[Erioch]], alongside Inquisitor [[Camilla Noesis]].{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
The two would offer no explanation, of how they had learned of [[Erioch]]'s hidden location. Instead, they simply said that the time was as it should be and their credentials and ciphers allowed them to enter the [[Watch Fortress]]. Their visit coincided with an opening of an [[Omega Vault]] chamber, which contained a [[Dark Age of Technology]] chronograph. It appeared to be meticulously marking a countdown of time, measuring the hours and their divisions with total precision. This reveal then caused Erioch's '''Chamber of Vigilance''' and the Inquisitors, to stand in discussion for thirteen days and nights. Once the talks were over, Kaleb and [[Camilla Noesis|Noesis]] left the Watch Fortress and the Inquisitors took all records of their discussions with them.{{Fn|1}} 

