Kambyses Gandash.wikitext:
{{AdeptusCustodesPortal}}
'''Kambyses Gandash''' is an [[Adeptus Custodes]] [[Blade Champion]], who wields the [[Klaimor]] [[Imperator Lux]]  and the [[Nemis]] [[Imperator Ira]].{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
While training in the [[Colosseia Auris]], Gandash looked upon the murals and mosaics on its walls, depicting past [[Blade Champion]]s and their triumphs. Among them were [[Sabium Karindas]], [[Hayani Rimush]] and [[Nabonideion Seleukis]], whose depiction was Gandash's favorite. He could recount their tales and the dozens more that adorned the Auris' walls. All served as inspiration and examples for all the [[Custodes]]. As he gazed upon the Blade Champions of the past, Gandash vowed to the fallen heroes, that he would prove himself worthy of their title.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[Codex: Adeptus Custodes (9th Edition)]], pg. 81 — ''Magisterium Lex Ultima''
