Kaminska.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
{{spoiler|source=Battle for the Abyss (Novel)}}
[[Rear Admiral]] '''Kaminska''' was the elderly commander of the [[Imperial Army]] warship ''[[Wrathful (Saturnine Fleet)|Wrathful]]'' and its [[escort]]s during the opening days of the [[Horus Heresy]].{{fn|1a}}

An officer of the [[Saturnine Fleet]], Kaminska decried the impending end of the Fleet's unique identity and traditions as it was absorbed entirely into the Imperial Army.{{fn|1c}} She resented the commandeering of her ships by [[Ultramarines]] [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Lysimachus Cestus]] but grew to grudgingly respect his honour and loyalty.{{fn|1b}}

Admiral Kaminska was killed when the [[Daemon]] [[Wsoric]] possessed her executive officer, Helmmistress Venkmyer, and slaughtered the remaining crew of the ''Wrathful'', previously crippled by the ''[[Furious Abyss]]''.{{fn|1d}}

