Kandar Vor Ostrakhan Lo Hannick.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
[[Captain (Imperial Guard)|Honoured Captain]] '''Kandar Vor Ostrakhan Lo Hannick'''{{Fn|2b}} was the commanding officer of the [[7th Paragonian Super-heavy Tank Company]], active in the late 300's.[[M41]].{{Fn|1}}{{Fn|2a}}


==Biography==
In addition to the [[Astra Militarum Company|company]] itself, Hannick had command of the company's lead [[Super Heavy Tank]] - the [[Hellhammer]] ''[[Ostrakhan's Rebirth]]''.{{Fn|1}}{{Fn|2a}}

Hannick led his company during the [[Kalidar War]] against the [[ork]]s of [[Waaagh! Gratzdakka]]{{Fn|1}} and on [[Geratomro]] putting down an anti-[[Imperial]] rebellion.{{Fn|2a}} However, he contracted [[dustlung]] while on [[Kalidar IV]] and, despite receiving a lung wash treatment, his condition worsened during the Geratomro campaign, becoming fatal. While on his deathbed aboard the [[medicae]] [[frigate]] ''[[Merciful Sister]]'', he made his recommendation for his successor as Honoured Captain of the 7th - [[Lieutenant (Imperial Guard)|Lieutenant]] [[Colaron Vor Artem Lo Bannick]] - although he did not know if this would be carried out.{{Fn|2b}}

==Sources==
