Kane (Assault Marine).wikitext:
{{UltramarinesPortal}}
'''Kane''' was an [[Assault Marine]] in the [[Ultramarines]]{{Fn|1}} [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]], who took part in the [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|2}}
==History==
He fought{{Fn|1}} in the [[Horus Heresy]]'s [[Battle of Tallarn]] and was part of the [[Imperial]] reinforcements, that broke through the blockade the [[Traitors]] had around the besieged world. Their efforts to deploy on [[Tallarn]] was nearly ended by a group of [[Legio Mortis]] [[Chaos Titan]]s, until the [[Legio Astorum]] [[Princeps]] [[Marnoc]] intervened with his [[Warlord Titan]] [[Fortunata Imperiatrix]] and saved them.{{Fn|2}} Kane and the Ultramarines then moved to retake the captured city '''Rogsburg''', with the aid of [[Imperial Titan]]s. However it was held by the [[Thousand Sons]], who were able to repel several of their attacks. In the Imperials' next attempt, they sought to seize Rogsburg's '''Bromium Refinery''' and the [[Assault Marine]] joined their efforts to do so. Eventually the attacks were successful and the city was reclaimed by the Imperial forces.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[White Dwarf 120 (UK)]], pg. 12 - ''Epic Battles: War Machines''
*{{Endn|2}}: [[Firepower Issue 1]], pgs. 76-77 

