Kapek.wikitext:
'''Kapek''' was an [[Imperial Guard]] [[Sergeant (Imperial Guard)|Sergeant]], who was killed during the Chaos insurrection on [[Sepus Prime]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
Kapek was a member of the [[Imperial Guard]], and was stationed on [[Sepus Prime]] during the Chaos insurrection of the planetary Governor [[Narbo]]. He was in command of his regiment's push to take the civitate, while Lieutenant [[Sorov]] attempted to ambush Narbo. His unit was attacked at Tadmor Ridge by insurrectionists using [[Lascannon]]s. The Imperial Guard called in aerial strikes, but these were unsuccessful, leading to his unit taking heavier casualities than expected. As Narbo flew in his [[Aquila Lander]] towards Tadmor Ridge to deal with Kapek's unit, Sorov contacted Kapek via [[Vox-Caster]], asking him to hold for ten more minutes. Despite minimal chances of survival, Kapek agreed.{{Fn|1}}

==Trivia==
{{Trivia}}
===Notes===
*It is not certain whether Kapek died trying to hold Tadmor Ridge, or during the [[Virus Bomb]]ing of Sepus Prime that followed.{{Fn|1}}
*Lieutenant [[Sorov]] said to his unit "you might even get off this rancid planet", implying that their regiment was not from [[Sepus Prime]].{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
