He has carved such a blood-drenched path through the stars, that Karagar has been awarded by the [[Blood God]], with a [[Juggernaut]], he now rides into battle{{Fn|1b}}. Under his leadership, the [[Karagar's Rampagers|Rampagers]] have not only been the terror for a score of the [[Laervold Belt]]'s worlds, but several outside of the belt as well. They care for nothing but killing in Khorne's name, leaving piles of heaped skulls in offering to the [[Chaos God]] and leaving charnel destruction in their wake. It is not clear, however, how the Rampagers travel from battlefield to battlefield, though rumors persist that they do so by using unholy portals formed from the swirling blood-tides of their butchered victims.{{Fn|1a}}

