'''Karpova''' is a [[Cadian Shock Troops]] [[Imperial Guard Captain|Captain]]. Her [[Regiment]] is among the [[Imperial]] forces that the [[Ultramarines]] [[Space Marine Lieutenant|Lieutenant]] [[Varus Castamon]], commands in the defense of the vital [[Sanctus Line]] world [[Regium]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
She is a [[Known Survivors of Cadia|survivor]] of her Homeworld [[Cadia]]'s [[13th Black Crusade#Fall of Cadia|destruction]], as Karpova's [[Regiment]] was fighting elsewhere when it occurred. The [[Imperial Guard Captain|Captain]] is driven to fight the [[Imperium]]'s enemies and among her battles was serving as a rearguard on [[Cynus IV]] and aiding in ending the siege on [[Sestos Prime]]. Karpova's Regiment is now serving on [[Regium]], which is a cornerstone of the vital [[Sanctus Line]], but being stationed there for so long has made her restless. With the Imperium's foes marching towards [[Terra]], Karpova is angered that her [[Guardsmen]] are spending their time moping up Regium's [[heretic]] cells, which she feels is beneath them and also a slight against her Regiment.{{Fn|1}}  

This finally reached a breaking point for Karpova, when her [[Regiment]] was made to provide protection for [[Regium]]'s [[Planetary Governor]] [[Seroc]], in the fortress city of '''Zarax''', as he spoke to the world's important officials. This was after the remnants of a [[Hive Fleet Leviathan|Leviathan]] [[Splinter Fleet]], entered Regium's [[System]], during the [[Fourth Tyrannic War]], and began casting the [[Shadow in the Warp]]. The [[Psychic]] backlash wreaked havoc across the world, leading Seroc to meet with the officials to assure them that [[Space Marine Lieutenant|Lieutenant]] [[Varus Castamon|Castamon]] had a plan to destroy the [[Xenos]]. Karpova knew at that very moment though, that the Lieutenant was discussing this very plan, somewhere else in Zarax, with his high ranking military officers, while the Captain was stuck watching over Seroc. Not being included in Castamon's meeting angered Karpova and she blamed this on the machinations of either [[Colonel]] [[Levizac]] or [[Major]] [[Lucanus]], who denigrated [[Cadian Regiment]]s. This made her all the more determined to speak with Castamon after Seroc's meeting was over and ask the Lieutenant to allow her Regiment to be stationed somewhere else. Though [[Imperial Guard Sergeant|Sergeant]] [[Vollard]] assured Karpova that their service on Regium was important, but the Captain refused to listen to her fellow Cadian. In her mind, with so many Imperial forces stationed on Regium, her Regiment leaving it would not lessen the world's defenses.{{Fn|1}} 

However before Karpova could follow through on this, [[Imperial Governor]] [[Seroc]], ended his meeting by stating he would be leaving '''Zarax''' for '''Salamis Hive'''. And that he would be taking Karpova and her [[Regiment]] with him to provide protection for the vital [[Hive]]. This immediately infuriated the [[Imperial Guard Captain|Captain]], but her temper rapidly cooled, as Seroc explained that it was at [[Space Marine Lieutenant|Lieutenant]] [[Varus Castamon|Castamon]]'s suggestion. This was after the Lieutenant had studied her record and stated Karpova was personally responsible for the successful rearguard action on [[Cynus IV]] and her skills as a tactician ended the siege on [[Sestos Prime]]. These public comments ended any anger the Captain had and she accepted her orders to follow Seroc to Salamis. Karpova did not realize, however, that Castamon had told Seroc exactly what he needed to say, in order to get her on the Governor's side.{{Fn|1}}   

