Karsk (Major).wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
[[Image:Major-karsk.png|thumb|right| Major Karsk{{fn|1b}}]]
'''Karsk''' is a [[Major]] in the [[Cadian Shock Troopers]], who commands a strike force known as [[Karsk's Gunners]].{{Fn|1a}}
==History==
He is a stern, disciplined commander and gifted strategist, who is accompanied by a cadre of specialist troopers who aid the [[Major]] in his command duties. Though the grizzled Karsk resembles the [[Imperium]]'s propaganda [[Astra Militarum]] vid-feeds of unforgiving commanders, he does at times display a grim gallows humor as he leads the Gunners.{{Fn|1b}} 
Currently his strike force is part of a much larger Astra Militarum muster, that is defending the [[System]]s of the [[Sanctus Wall]]. Thanks to the Major's leadership, their tight regimental discipline and raw overwhelming firepower, the Gunners have prevailed over not only the forces of [[Chaos]], but [[Xenos]] [[Pirate]]s and [[heretic]] insurgents. As far as Karsk is concerned, the strike force will continue to defeat any foe they face, for as long as the Gunners draw breath. {{Fn|1a}}

==Wargear==
'''Karsk''' is equipped with a [[plasma pistol]] and a [[power sword]]. {{Fn|1a}}

