{{EmperorsChildrenPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a member of the [[Emperor's Children]].

A native of [[Chemos]], Telmar became an accomplished member of his [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]] and captain of the [[12th Company (Emperor's Children)|12th Company]] during the [[Great Crusade]]. He was part of [[Fulgrim]]'s select squad of warriors to accompany him to [[Byzas]].{{Fn|1}} During the [[Horus Heresy]], Telmar fell with the bulk of his Legion to [[Chaos]].{{Fn|2a}}

After the Heresy, Telmar became androgynously beautiful warlord of [[Slaanesh]] known as the '''Radiant King in His Joyful Repose''', leading a [[12th Company (Emperor's Children)|powerful warband]] himself while joining [[Eidolon (Emperor's Children)|Eidolon]]'s [[Phoenix Conclave]].{{Fn|2a}} In [[M34]] Telmar was confronted by his old subordinate [[Oleander Koh]] and [[Fabius Bile]], who convinced him to launch an assault on [[Craftworld]] [[Lugganath]]. Telmar hoped to not only claim the Craftworld for himself, but to also ascend to [[Daemonhood]].{{Fn|2b}}

During the [[The Shattering|subsequent battle]] Telmar consumed a great many [[Spirit Stone]]s and began to transform into a [[Daemon Prince]]. However, he became surrounded by a force of [[Harlequin]]s and Lugganathi [[Warlock]]s and was cut down before the transformation was complete.{{Fn|2b}}

