While Garrix is a competent tactician at best, few are more fearsome in battle than the skull-helmed warrior himself. Wielding an axe that stands taller than most mortals, the [[Headsman (Red Corsairs)|Headsman]] has claimed the lives of many enemy champions. Quite a few of his fellow [[Red Corsairs]] have also met their ends at Garrix's hands as well. As the [[Chaos Warband|Warband]]'s Headsman, it is Garrix who will kill any Red Corsair who disappoints their lord [[Huron Blackheart]] beyond redemption and then wastes their final moments begging for mercy. He is a butcher, however, who lives to cause death in glorious single combat. While he currently serves Blackheart, Garrix's is not a creature whom loyaltiy comes to easily. If the commander of the Red Corsairs was replaced, Garrix will simply follow a new master - provided they give the Headsman the opportunity to wet his axe with blood.{{Fn|1}} 

