'''Kauragar''' was a [[Centurion (Rank)|Centurion]] in the [[World Eaters]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]] who was marked for death by the Traitorous forces of [[Horus]] during the [[Battle of Isstvan III]], for his loyalty to the [[Emperor]].{{Fn|1}}

When [[Angron]] came to [[Isstvan III]]'s surface to personally end the lives of the Loyalist World Eaters, Kauragar managed to wound him before the Primarch struck him down, leaving him mortally wounded. As he lay dying, Angron stood over Kauragar and told him he had fought well, before explaining to the questioning Centurion why he had betrayed the Emperor and joined forces with Horus.{{Fn|1}}

