Kaurl.wikitext:
{{ImperialNavyPortal}}
'''Kaurl''' is an [[Imperial Navy]] [[Imperial Navy Captain|Captain]] who commands the [[Cruiser]] [[Divine Justice]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
Kaurl ceded command to [[Admiral]] [[Veniston]] after the Divine became a part of a small [[Imperial Navy]] fleet in late [[M41]]. This fleet was on an extended patrol, during which Kaurl served as Veniston's second in command aboard the Divine. The fleet would go on to destroy an [[Ork]] [[Space Hulk]], and a year and a half later, it resupplied on [[Saltius]]. There they received new orders to join the Imperial Navy fleet that was fighting to reclaim [[Mearopyis]] from the [[Noctal]] species. When the fleet arrived, though, the Navy's Sector Command placed Veniston in command of the entire fleet. He then replaced the recalled [[Admiral]] [[Kright]] and also took command of the [[Battleship]] [[Holy Dignity]]. With the Admiral's departure, the Divine Justice was once again under Kaurl's command, for which the [[Imperial Navy Captain|Captain]] was extremely grateful.{{Fn|1}}  

