'''{{PAGENAME}}''', also spelled '''KX-8''', is an [[Enginseer]] of the [[Adeptus Mechanicus]] and foremost [[tech priest]] serving the [[Rogue Trader]] Shipmistress [[Emora Brahms|Brahms]]. He attends to her flagship, the ''[[Mourningstar]]'', and all machinery aboard.{{Fn|1a}}

==Overview==
[[Image:Enginseer_Kayex-8.jpg|thumb|right|160px|Enginseer {{PAGENAME}}{{Fn|1}}]]
In early [[M42]], he continues his long service to the rogue trader as the Shipmistress, and by extension those in service to her, aid in [[Inquisitor]] [[Grendyl]]'s goals on [[Atoma Prime]].{{Fn|1e}}

The Inquisitor's foremost [[tech priest]] [[acolyte]], [[Technoarcheologist]] [[Hadron Omega-7-7]], first requested the assistance of Kayex-8 in order to find an illicit [[stimm]] production facility within district HL-70-04, "[[The Carnival]]", of [[Hive Tertium]]. Kayex had done a deep system-study of the district prior, and Hadron requested that he link into the systems to search for anomalies in the local fusion grid. Hadron suspected that the hidden [[poxwalker|blight]]ed-stimm production facility used by the [[Traitor Guardsmen|treacherous]] [[Moebian 6th]] was using large amounts of power siphoned from the local power grid.{{Fn|1a}} 

An Enginseer's skill as a technician and knowledge of machine lore is unsurpassed by any other [[human]]. Through their [[techno-empathy]] they can interface their mind directly with a [[Cogitator]] to track down malfunctions, access a database, or reconstruct a program.{{Fn|2}} Kayex-8 employs this skill to track down the anomalous activity in the fusion grid and directs an [[Inquisition]] strike team to the location of the blighted stimm production facility deep in Warren 6-19. As strike teams near the heretic-controlled facility Kayex-8 becomes more and more enraged by their torture and perversion of the [[machine spirit]]s in Tertium. He seeks vengeance for these Children of the Omnissiah and hopes Hive Tertium's machines can be restored to their pious functions once again.{{Fn|1a}} 

===Moebian Steel Research===
With the recent discovery of [[Clandestium Gloriana]], a long-forgotten manufactory deep within the bowels of Tertium was recently rediscovered, and with it the ability to produce [[Moebian Steel]]. This steel is far better than the standard steel produced in Tertium.{{Fn|1d}} However the facility is only able to produce small amounts of Moebian Steel and a time and is an area contested by Moebian 6th.{{Fn|1c}}

[[Hadron Omega-7-7]] is researching this ancient [[archeotech]] marvel and attempting to recreate the processes of [[Moebian Steel]] production on a larger scale in HL-17-16, known as [[Metalfab 36]].{{Fn|1b}} The Enginseer's technical skill is required in order to help facilitate her experiments to unlock the [[Rite of Steel]] using the metalfab's primary smelter.{{Fn|1c}}

