Kelmer.wikitext:
{{ImperialNavyPortal}}
'''Kelmer''' was a bellicose [[nobleman]], who was once the [[Groupmaster]] of [[Indomitus Crusade Fleet Quartus]]' [[Battle Group Forthrax]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
This ended, though, when he advanced upon the [[Chaos]]-held [[Stygion System]], where Kelmer's advisors counseled he take a cautions approach to it. However after winning a string of increasingly improbable victories over the [[Ysmar Sub-sector]]'s [[Cults]], Kelmer refused to do so and ordered a full-scale attack on Stygion. This allowed the Battle Group to fall victim to an ambush by the [[Alpha Legion]] and [[Night Lords]], who inflicted heavy causalities on Forthrax's forces. Kelmer was among those who were killed and [[Yosharo DuGal|DuGal]] took command of the Battle Group's remnants afterwards. While the [[Chapter Master]] was able to lead them out of the System, over a third of Forthrax's strength was lost to the [[Traitor Legion]]s. This disastrous battle became known as [[Kelmer's Folly]] and was a black mark of shame upon [[Indomitus Crusade Fleet Quartus|Fleet Quartus]]' history.{{Fn|1}}  

