Keltru.wikitext:
{{ScythesOfTheEmperorPortal}}
'''Keltru''' was a [[Space Marine]] of the [[Scythes of the Emperor]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1a}} 

==History==
While a [[Space Marine Scout|Scout]], Keltru was a member of [[Squad Rezyk]].{{Fn|1d}}  By the [[Second Tyrannic War]], he was serving in the [[4th Company (Scythes of the Emperor)|4th Company]] under [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] [[Marek Angeloi|Angeloi]].{{Fn|1a}}

Keltru was amongst those Marines to survive the [[Fall of Sotha]], making it to the Chapter's muster point in the [[Miral System]] alive.  While in the Miral System, the remaining Scythes stopped off at [[Miral Prime]], which held a Chapter outpost on a mesa known as the [[Giant's Coffin]], in order to resupply and collect any [[Aspirant]]s and [[Neophyte]]s that were being trained there.{{Fn|1a}}

In an effort to step up the rate of recruitment, [[Scout Sergeant]] [[Brimelow]] sent out teams to find more Mirali tribesmen who could replenish the depleted Chapter.  In order to navigate the [[Death World|Death World's]] jungles, teams of two Marines were sent out with a local escort.  Keltru was sent out with [[Brother]] [[Culmonios]] and a Mirali Neophyte named [[Hwygir]].{{Fn|1a}}{{Fn|1b}}  On their expedition into the jungles, the team encountered a [[Land Shark|Miral land shark]], which severely wounded Keltru, resulting in the loss of both of the Marine's legs.{{Fn|1b}}{{Fn|1c}}{{Fn|1d}}

As the Chapter's [[Apothecarion]] completely lacked the resources necessary to produce [[Imperial bionics|augmetic limbs]] for him at the time, Keltru was assigned to bastion command at the Scythes' outpost on Miral Prime when a [[Miral Rex|tyranid splinter fleet]] invaded the Miral System.{{Fn|1d}}

