Kenai was not [[Sotha]]n by birth; he was instead recruited from the planet [[Beremin]].  Kenai served as a member of [[Cassander (Squad)|Squad Cassander]] following the [[Fall of Sotha]], wielding the squad's [[flamer]]. He took part in a mission to extract [[Apothecary]] [[Aratus]] from a Chapter outpost on [[Brakur IV]] when the [[Brakur System]] was invaded by the [[Tyranid]]s of [[Hive Fleet Kraken]].{{Fn|1}}

During the aerial drop onto Brakur IV, the squad's [[Storm Eagle Assault Gunship|Storm Eagle]] was destroyed by a [[Harridan]].{{Fn|1}} Kenai was killed in the attack.{{Fn|2}}

