'''Kerrig Thrax''' is a member of the [[Serpent's Teeth]] [[Alpha Legion]] [[Chaos Warband|Warband]] and is the leader of its '''Ninth Fang''' squadron.{{Fn|1}}
==History==
In [[M42]] he took part in the [[Serpent's Teeth]]'s invasion of the [[Imperial]] world [[Pendata (World)|Pendata]], which saw it nearly overrun. However before the Imperium's rule could be overthrown, the [[Indomitus Crusade]] forces of the [[Silver Templars]] came to its aid. When [[Chaos Lord|Captain]] [[Krozier Va'kai]] informed the Warband of this, [[Harrowmaster]] [[Drazus Jate]] ordered Thrax's '''Ninth Fang''' and [[Trayvar Thrice-Burned]]'s '''Eighth Fang''' squadrons to seize a number of [[Hydra Flak Tank]]s. Once these were under their control, the Fang squadrons followed Jate's commands and fired upon the Silver Templars' incoming transports, which were racing to their location. While they were able to destroy several of the transports, the rest landed and deployed the [[Chapter]]'s forces. This was the [[Serpent's Teeth]]'s first encounter with [[Primaris Space Marines]] and the Silver Templars soon overwhelmed the two squadrons. With the immediate threat dealt with, the Primaris then began hunting for the other members of the Serpent's Teeth.{{Fn|1}} 

