Kh'har'ret.wikitext:
{{KhornePortal}}
'''Kh'har'ret the Butcher''' is a [[Bloodmaster]] of [[Khorne]]{{Fn|1b}}, who commands the [[Butchers of Hyporia]] [[Daemon]] cohort.{{Fn|1a}}
==History==
He is a malevolent distillation of murderous rage and slaughter, who emerged victorious from the [[Chaos God]]'s [[Skullpit]] and was unleashed to lead [[Khorne]]'s [[Daemons]] to war{{Fn|1b}}. Since then, Kh'har'ret and his [[Butchers of Hyporia|Butchers]] have been able to be conjured into [[Realspace]] through terrible acts of bloodshed and murder. One such summoning led the Daemons to rampage across the [[Hyporia Cluster]], which earned the cohort its name and led it to become a dark legend, throughout the Cluster and beyond. However even the most proscribed and lurid folklore surrounding the Butchers, falls short of the true horror Kh'har'ret is capable of.{{Fn|1a}}

