Khagashu.wikitext:
{{NightLordsPortal}}
'''Khagashu''' was a member of the [[Night Lords]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]], who took part in the [[Horus Heresy]]'s [[Siege of Terra]].{{Fn|1a}}
==History==
Near the end of the [[Siege of Terra|Siege]], Khagashu heard murmurs from shadows and damp air that instructed him to build a giant throne of skulls, from the dead of the [[Imperial Palace]]'s '''Eirenicon Gate'''. The [[Night Lord]] was not alone in hearing this and he commanded a group of feral [[Human]]s, [[Abhuman]]s and cankered [[Servitor]]s for the task. The throne was for an [[Chaos God|ascendant coronation]] upon [[Chaos]]' victory on [[Terra]], but Khagashu was unsure of who would sit upon it{{Fn|1a}}. The Night Lord later successfully completed building the throne, during the [[Emperor]]'s boarding attack on [[Warmaster]] [[Horus]]' flagship, the [[Vengeful Spirit]].{{Fn|1b}}

