Khalen.wikitext:
{{RavenGuardPortal}}
'''Khalen''' was a [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] of the [[Raven Guard]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]], active during the [[Great Crusade]] and [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
He was among those elements of the Raven Guard that participated in the [[Scalland Campaign]]. Notably, Khalen was one of the Legionaries issued with the first prototype suits of [[Space Marine Power Armour|power armour]] that would later form the basis of the [[Mark VI Power Armour]] design. The armour served Khalen well, and some of his observations on the armour's performance during the campaign would influence the final design of the Mark VI.{{Fn|1}}

Later, Khalen was among those Raven Guard deployed to [[Isstvan V]] at the outbreak of the Horus Heresy. According to records, he survived the [[Dropsite Massacre]].{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[The Horus Heresy Book Three - Extermination]], pg. 142

