Khalophis.wikitext:
{{ThousandSonsPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] of the [[Thousand Sons]] during the [[Great Crusade]] and [[Horus Heresy]].  Commanding the [[6th Fellowship (Thousand Sons)|6th Fellowship]], he oversaw the [[Pyrae]] Cult.{{Fn|1a}}

During the [[Burning of Prospero]] Khalophis sent his consciousness into the inert [[Warlord Class Titan]] ''[[Canis Vertex]]'', taking control of the machine.{{Fn|1b}}  With his soul inside the Titan, Khalophis wrought destruction on the [[Space Wolves]] and their allies, nearly turning the tide of the battle.{{Fn|1c}}  However, ''Canis Vertex'' was caught in the psychic explosion caused by the death of [[7th Fellowship (Thousand Sons)|7th Fellowship]] captain [[Phael Toron]], causing the Titan to explode and annihilating Khalophis' soul.{{Fn|1d}}

