Khanzing.wikitext:
{{IronWarriorsPortal}}
'''Khanzing''' is an [[Iron Warriors]] [[Warsmith]], whose forces hold the '''Fortress Perditum''' on [[Hanorio V]].{{Fn|1}} 

Sometime after the [[Great Rift]]'s creation, though, [[Lord Commander]] [[Roboute Guilliman|Guilliman]] ordered the Fortress to be attacked by the [[Imperial Fists]]' [[3rd Company (Imperial Fists)|3rd Company]] and the [[Harakoni Warhawks|Harakoni 117th]] [[Regiment]]. [[Colonel]] [[Thraxos]]'s Regiment suffered heavy losses in the battle, however, and it ultimately fell to the Fists' 3rd Company under [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Tor Garadon]] to attempt to storm the Fortress using a flaw in its design. The final outcome of the battle is not known though.{{Fn|1}}

